<html>
  <head>
    <link
      rel="icon"
      href="https://bb.com.br/site/wp-content/themes/portal40/img/icn-am.ico"
      type="image/x-icon"
    />
  </head>
  <style>
    @font-face {
      font-family: relacionamento;
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      src: url("data:font/woff;base64,")
          format("woff"),
        url("data:application/octet-stream;base64,")
          format("truetype");
    }
    .bbds-rel {
      font-family: relacionamento;
    }
    .bbds-rel--bb-icon:before {
      content: "\f103";
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: BancoDoBrasilTextos-Regular;
      src: url("data:font/woff2;base64,")
        format("woff2");
    }
    @font-face {
      font-family: BancoDoBrasilTitulos-Regular;
      src: url("data:font/woff2;base64,")
        format("woff2");
    }
    html,
    body {
      margin: 0px;
      background-color: #f6f6f6;
    }
    .banner {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #fdf429;
      padding: 15px;
    }
    .logo {
      margin-left: 23%;
      color: #465eff;
      font-size: 60px;
    }
    .header {
      padding-top: 20px;
      margin-left: 23%;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      padding-left: 15px;
      color: #465eff;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .content {
      padding-top: 10px;
      margin-left: 23%;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      padding-left: 15px;
      line-height: 30px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #696969;
    }
    .bottom {
      padding-top: 10px;
      margin-left: 23%;
      padding-left: 15px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #696969;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 50px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 10px;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-family: "BancoDoBrasilTitulos-Regular";
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: normal;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      line-height: 32px;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
      font-family: "BancoDoBrasilTitulos-Regular";
    }
    a {
      color: #465eff;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    a:hover,
    a:visited {
      color: #465eff;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    body {
      font-family: "BancoDoBrasilTextos-Regular";
    }
  </style>
  <body>
    <div class="banner">
      <div class="logo">
        <bb-icon
          _ngcontent-serverapp-c122=""
          pack="bbds-rel"
          icon="bb-icon"
          bbnavbariconlogoref=""
          class="bbds-rel bbds-rel--bb-icon"
        ></bb-icon>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="header">
      <br />
      <h1>Ops!</h1>
      <br />
      <h2>Erro no acesso.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      Por favor, confira a URL requisitada ou volte para a
      <a
        href="https://www.bb.com.br"
        data-octo-conversao="false"
        data-octo-rotulo="p&aacute;gina inicial :: href: https://www.bb.com.br"
        >p&aacute;gina inicial</a
      >.<br />
      Caso necess&aacute;rio entre em contato com o suporte técnico e informe o
      identificador de seguran&ccedil;a (ID) e o seu IP :<br /><br /><br />
      <h2>9f9750931c405326</h2>
      <br />
      <h2>IP : 131.100.62.169</h2>
      <br />
    </div>
    <br />

    <div class="bottom">
      <b>Regi&otilde;es Metropolitanas: <a href="tel:40040001">4004 0001</a></b
      ><br />
      <b>Demais Regi&otilde;es: <a href="tel:08007290001">0800 729 0001</a></b
      ><br />
      <b
        >Fale Pelo WhatsApp:
        <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=556140040001"
          >(61) 4004 0001</a
        ></b
      ><br />
      <b>24 horas - todos os dias.</b>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
